      {
        "id": 17622,
        "title": "Доступность WAI-ARIA",
        "type": "practiceLevel3",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 149471,
            "contentType": "executableFiles",
            "images": [],
            "executableContent": {
              "instructions": "Этот игровой HUD нуждается в способе объявить важное игровое предупреждение для игроков, использующих экранные дикторы. Включите роль `\"alert\"` в контейнер `div`, чтобы убедиться, что все об этом знают.",
              "preselectedFileIndex": 0,
              "hasVisualOutput": true,
              "files": [
                {
                  "name": "index.html",
                  "codeLanguage": "html",
                  "content": "<!doctype html>\n<html>\n <body>\n  <div id=\"game\">\n   <h1>Dungeon Runner</h1>\n   <img src=\"https://mimo.app/i/graffiti.png\" alt=\"player sprite\" />\n   <h2>Choose your loadout</h2>\n   <label for=\"playerName\">Player name:</label>\n   <input type=\"text\" id=\"playerName\" />\n   <br>\n   <label for=\"difficulty\">Select difficulty:</label>\n   <input type=\"date\" id=\"difficulty\" />\n   <div role=\"\">Low health! Find a potion before the next fight.</div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html>",
                  "solvedContent": "<!doctype html>\n<html>\n <body>\n  <div id=\"game\">\n   <h1>Dungeon Runner</h1>\n   <img src=\"https://mimo.app/i/graffiti.png\" alt=\"player sprite\" />\n   <h2>Choose your loadout</h2>\n   <label for=\"playerName\">Player name:</label>\n   <input type=\"text\" id=\"playerName\" />\n   <br>\n   <label for=\"difficulty\">Select difficulty:</label>\n   <input type=\"date\" id=\"difficulty\" />\n   <div role=\"alert\">Low health! Find a potion before the next fight.</div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html>"
                }
              ],
              "hints": []
            }
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 149472,
            "contentType": "executableFiles",
            "images": [],
            "executableContent": {
              "instructions": "Вы можете увидеть важную информацию в заголовке меню игры, такую как логотип и название в верхней части экрана. Добавьте соответствующую `role` для этого типа информации в элемент `div`.",
              "preselectedFileIndex": 0,
              "hasVisualOutput": true,
              "files": [
                {
                  "name": "index.html",
                  "codeLanguage": "html",
                  "content": "<!doctype html>\n<html>\n <body>\n  <div>\n   <img src=\"https://mimo.app/i/insta.png\" alt=\"game logo\"\n    width=\"200\" />\n   <h1>Start your quest and beat the high score!</h1>\n  </div>\n  <img src=\"https://mimo.app/i/portrait-cv.png\" alt=\"Portrait of a hero\"\n   width=\"80\" />\n  <img src=\"https://mimo.app/i/lee.png\" alt=\"Portrait of a rival\"\"\n    width=\" 80\" />\n  <h4>Tip: Dodge first, attack second.</h4>\n </body>\n</html>",
                  "solvedContent": "<!doctype html>\n<html>\n <body>\n  <div role=\"banner\">\n   <img src=\"https://mimo.app/i/insta.png\" alt=\"game logo\"\n    width=\"200\" />\n   <h1>Start your quest and beat the high score!</h1>\n  </div>\n  <img src=\"https://mimo.app/i/portrait-cv.png\" alt=\"Portrait of a hero\"\n   width=\"80\" />\n  <img src=\"https://mimo.app/i/lee.png\" alt=\"Portrait of a rival\"\"\n    width=\" 80\" />\n  <h4>Tip: Dodge first, attack second.</h4>\n </body>\n</html>"
                }
              ],
              "hints": []
            }
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 149473,
            "contentType": "executableFiles",
            "images": [],
            "executableContent": {
              "instructions": "На этой странице игры есть два `chat messages` игрока, обернутые в `div`. Давайте добавим необходимую `role` в оба элемента `div`.",
              "preselectedFileIndex": 0,
              "hasVisualOutput": true,
              "files": [
                {
                  "name": "index.html",
                  "codeLanguage": "html",
                  "content": "<!doctype html>\n<html>\n <body>\n  <img src=\"https://mimo.app/i/wakande.png\" alt=\"enemy sprite\" width=\"200\" />\n  <h1>Guild Chat</h1>\n  <div>\n   <h3>Boss fight was epic</h3>\n   <p>We barely survived, but the loot drop was worth it.</p>\n   <p>March, 2011</p>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n   <h3>Great co-op run</h3>\n   <p>Teamwork was perfect and the final combo looked awesome.</p>\n   <p>May, 2020</p>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html>",
                  "solvedContent": "<!doctype html>\n<html>\n <body>\n  <img src=\"https://mimo.app/i/wakande.png\" alt=\"enemy sprite\" width=\"200\" />\n  <h1>Guild Chat</h1>\n  <div role=\"comment\">\n   <h3>Boss fight was epic</h3>\n   <p>We barely survived, but the loot drop was worth it.</p>\n   <p>March, 2011</p>\n  </div>\n  <div role=\"comment\">\n   <h3>Great co-op run</h3>\n   <p>Teamwork was perfect and the final combo looked awesome.</p>\n   <p>May, 2020</p>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html>"
                }
              ],
              "hints": []
            }
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 149474,
            "contentType": "executableFiles",
            "images": [],
            "executableContent": {
              "instructions": "Нам нужно добавить элемент `div` ниже последнего `section`, который содержит информацию, повторяющуюся внизу каждого игрового экрана. Добавь его с соответствующим `role`.",
              "preselectedFileIndex": 0,
              "hasVisualOutput": true,
              "files": [
                {
                  "name": "index.html",
                  "codeLanguage": "html",
                  "content": "<!doctype html>\n<html>\n <body>\n  <h1>Pixel Arena</h1>\n  <img src=\"https://mimo.app/i/learn-coffee.png\" alt=\"arena background\"\n   width=\"300\" />\n  <section>\n   <h2>How to Play</h2>\n   <p>Move your hero, avoid hazards, and collect coins to increase your score.</p>\n  </section>\n  <section>\n   <h2>Power-Ups</h2>\n   <p>Pick up shields to reduce damage and potions to restore health.</p>\n  </section>\n  \n  <>\n   <p>By Sam and Neil Swayer</p>\n   <p>Copyright &copy; 2000</p>\n  </>\n </body>\n</html>",
                  "solvedContent": "<!doctype html>\n<html>\n <body>\n  <h1>Pixel Arena</h1>\n  <img src=\"https://mimo.app/i/learn-coffee.png\" alt=\"arena background\"\n   width=\"300\" />\n  <section>\n   <h2>How to Play</h2>\n   <p>Move your hero, avoid hazards, and collect coins to increase your score.</p>\n  </section>\n  <section>\n   <h2>Power-Ups</h2>\n   <p>Pick up shields to reduce damage and potions to restore health.</p>\n  </section>\n  <div role=\"contentinfo\">\n   <p>By Sam and Neil Swayer</p>\n   <p>Copyright &copy; 2000</p>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html>"
                }
              ],
              "hints": []
            }
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 149475,
            "contentType": "executableFiles",
            "images": [],
            "executableContent": {
              "instructions": "Элементы `h1` и `button` уже имеют значение, связанное с их тегами, и являются доступными. Удалите избыточные и ненужные `roles`.",
              "preselectedFileIndex": 0,
              "hasVisualOutput": true,
              "files": [
                {
                  "name": "index.html",
                  "codeLanguage": "html",
                  "content": "<!doctype html>\n<html>\n <body>\n  <h1 role=\"heading\">Sky Raiders</h1>\n  <img src=\"https://mimo.app/i/plane.png\" alt=\"ship sprite\" width=\"200\" />\n  <button role=\"button\">Press to start</button>\n </body>\n</html>",
                  "solvedContent": "<!doctype html>\n<html>\n <body>\n  <h1>Sky Raiders</h1>\n  <img src=\"https://mimo.app/i/plane.png\" alt=\"ship sprite\" width=\"200\" />\n  <button>Press to start</button>\n </body>\n</html>"
                }
              ],
              "hints": []
            }
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 149476,
            "contentType": "executableFiles",
            "images": [],
            "executableContent": {
              "instructions": "Мы работаем над экраном истории игры, но есть абзац, который не готов для экранных читалок. Давайте **скроем** **второй** элемент `p` от экранных читалок с помощью необходимого атрибута.",
              "preselectedFileIndex": 0,
              "hasVisualOutput": true,
              "files": [
                {
                  "name": "index.html",
                  "codeLanguage": "html",
                  "content": "<!doctype html>\n<html>\n <body>\n  <h1>Story Mode</h1>\n  <img src=\"https://mimo.app/i/haunting_poster.png\" alt=\"level poster\"\n   width=\"100\" />\n  <h2>Level 1: The Ember Gate</h2>\n  <p>As your hero enters the ruins, the air grows hot and the torches ignite one by one.</p>\n  <button>Continue</button>\n  <p>Screen Readers shouldn't see this</p>\n </body>\n</html>",
                  "solvedContent": "<!doctype html>\n<html>\n <body>\n  <h1>Story Mode</h1>\n  <img src=\"https://mimo.app/i/haunting_poster.png\" alt=\"level poster\"\n   width=\"100\" />\n  <h2>Level 1: The Ember Gate</h2>\n  <p>As your hero enters the ruins, the air grows hot and the torches ignite one by one.</p>\n  <button>Continue</button>\n  <p aria-hidden>Screen Readers shouldn't see this</p>\n </body>\n</html>"
                }
              ],
